### JWT Authentication & Authorization Test Cases
### 这个文件演示如何使用 Spring Security + JWT 进行认证和授权

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = testuser123
@password = testpass123
@email = testuser@example.com

### 1. 用户注册
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "email": "{{email}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
    client.global.set("userId", response.body.user.id);
    console.log("✅ 注册成功！");
    console.log("Token: " + response.body.token);
%}

### 2. 用户登录 (获取 JWT Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
    console.log("✅ 登录成功！");
    console.log("Token: " + response.body.token);
    console.log("Expires In: " + response.body.expiresIn + " 秒");
%}

### 3. 获取当前用户信息（需要有效 Token）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    console.log("✅ 获取用户信息成功");
    console.log("用户名: " + response.body.username);
    console.log("邮箱: " + response.body.email);
    console.log("角色: " + response.body.role);
%}

### 4. 验证 Token 有效性
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    console.log("✅ Token 验证成功");
%}

### 5. 测试受保护的端点：创建账户（需要认证，USER 角色）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/account
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ownerName": "Test User",
  "accountNumber": "ACC-001-{{$randomInt(10000, 99999)}}"
}

> {%
    console.log("✅ 账户创建成功");
    console.log("账户号: " + response.body.accountNumber);
    console.log("所有人: " + response.body.ownerName);
%}

### 6. 测试受保护的端点：获取账户信息（需要认证）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/ACC-001-12345
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    if (response.status === 200) {
        console.log("✅ 成功获取账户信息");
        console.log(response.body);
    } else {
        console.log("❌ 账户不存在或无权限");
    }
%}

### 7. 测试转账接口（需要认证，USER 角色）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/account/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccountNumber": "ACC-FROM-001",
  "toAccountNumber": "ACC-TO-001",
  "amount": "100.00",
  "currency": "USD",
  "requestId": "REQ-{{$randomInt(100000, 999999)}}-{{$timestamp}}"
}

> {%
    console.log("✅ 转账请求已接受");
    console.log("响应: " + response.body);
%}

### 8. 测试无效 Token（应该被拒绝）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid-token-here

> {%
    if (response.status === 403 || response.status === 401) {
        console.log("✅ 正确：无效 Token 被拒绝");
    }
%}

### 9. 测试无 Token 访问受保护端点（应该被拒绝）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

> {%
    if (response.status === 403 || response.status === 401 || response.status === 302) {
        console.log("✅ 正确：无 Token 被拒绝");
    }
%}

### 10. 测试错误的密码登录（应该失败）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

> {%
    if (response.status === 401 || response.status === 400) {
        console.log("✅ 正确：错误密码登录被拒绝");
        console.log("错误信息: " + response.body.message);
    }
%}

### 11. 健康检查（不需要认证）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/account/health-check

> {%
    console.log("✅ 服务健康检查：" + response.body);
%}
